#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/terraform.rst:19
msgid "Github/Git Repo"
msgstr "Github/Git Repo"

#: ../../integration_guides/Automation/terraform.rst:21
msgid ""
"To use .tf files from a Git repo, a Git or Github integration needs to be"
" configured in |AdmInt|. If one is not configured, .tf or .tf.json files "
"can be manually drafted in |morpheus| and added to Terraform App "
"Blueprints but they could not be sourced from version control "
"repositories."
msgstr ""
"To use .tf archivos desde un Git repo, un Git o Github integration "
"necesita ser configurado in |AdmInt|. If one no está configurado, .tf o "
".tf.json archivos puede be manualmente drafted in |morpheus| y agregado "
"to Terraform App Blueprints pero they podría no be sourced desde versión "
"control repositories."

