msgstr ".. image:: images/integration_guides/terr_inst_guide/13stateTab.png"

#: ../../getting_started/guides/terraform_instances.rst:214
msgid ""
"|morpheus| will also regularly check for drift from the Terraform "
"configuration. On the State tab near the top is a \"Drift Status\" "
"indicator. This will either show Drift or No Drift depending on the "
"situation. |morpheus| will automatically check for drift every few "
"minutes but you can perform a manual check at any time by clicking "
":guilabel:`REFRESH STATE`. Drift can be corrected when needed by "
"reapplying state (:guilabel:`APPLY STATE` button)."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| será también regularly check para drift desde el Terraform "
"configuración. En el State pestaña near el top es un \"Drift Status\" "
"indicator. This será either show Drift o No Drift dependiendo de el "
"situation. |morpheus| será automáticamente check para drift cada few "
"minutes pero you puede perform un manual check at cualquier time by "
"clicking :guilabel:`REFRESH STATE`. Drift puede be corrected cuando "
"needed by reapplying state (:guilabel:`APPLY STATE` botón)."

